          "rhetorical job: thank the reader, restate the method without formulas, then give one grade and one percentage",
          "analytical job: report Excellent and the 38.7 percent cut",
          "output: the reassurance and the plea to keep faith",
          "handoff: the reference list closes the paper"
        ]
      },
